{"name": "DARKDRAW", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DECK WORKSHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One deck per clan, built card by card from your collection. Every card costs dust based on its rarity, and your budget is limited: a handful of legendaries, or a deck that's solid from top to bottom? Expand your budget at the Abyssal Trading Post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/594877ac4c78efef6607148c3fb8ab79.poster.avif?t=1793578260\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/594877ac4c78efef6607148c3fb8ab79.webm?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/594877ac4c78efef6607148c3fb8ab79.mp4?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DESCENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A branching map of 15 floors leading to the act's boss: battles, elites, events, a merchant, campfires. No two runs are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/a1b06c14f50c092655a72a7b03ecc06b.poster.avif?t=1793578260\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/a1b06c14f50c092655a72a7b03ecc06b.webm?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/a1b06c14f50c092655a72a7b03ecc06b.mp4?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLES ON A BOARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon creatures, aim, attack, shield your hero. Taunt, Super Shield, Vampirism, Last Breath: fights play like a collectible card game, against an AI that plans its moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/345f326ada301623967b2f476166fa9d.poster.avif?t=1793578260\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/345f326ada301623967b2f476166fa9d.webm?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/345f326ada301623967b2f476166fa9d.mp4?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EARN EXPERIENCE AND UPGRADE YOUR DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn experience, draw new cards at the Abyssal Trading Post, unlock heroes, build your decks, then go deeper: ten Depth levels await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/97033dc1e849d110e4f1098c07966480.poster.avif?t=1793578260\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/97033dc1e849d110e4f1098c07966480.webm?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/97033dc1e849d110e4f1098c07966480.mp4?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE TORCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>It burns down every turn. In full light you hold the upper hand; in the dark, the rules turn against you. Some clans, though, thrive in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/3e135b8406a3e79e1ff896acb6a27576.poster.avif?t=1793578260\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/3e135b8406a3e79e1ff896acb6a27576.webm?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/extras/3e135b8406a3e79e1ff896acb6a27576.mp4?t=1793578260\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Descend into the Abyss with a fading torch. Darkdraw is a roguelike deckbuilder where every battle is fought on a board, creature against creature, and the dying light changes the rules. Pick your clan, build your deck, keep your flame alive.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361220/3476ad845f8c93837dd3a73fbdd574ede26112eb/header.jpg?t=1793578260", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "PvE", "Strategy", "Difficult", "Card Game"], "developers": "Thib Games", "publishers": "Thib Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4361220", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/OMUpQwFTLmc", "first_seen": 1794438000.0, "review_rank": 6}